OL,3,GNEWSA'Collapsed bridge findings' and
OL,4,A'Animal cruelty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local news websites in the
OL,8,FWest of England.
OL,10,FGloucestershire live reported on a dog
OL,11,Fcalled Candy, who had to be put down
OL,12,Fafter being found covered in fleas and
OL,13,Fsuffering from malnutrition. Her owner,
OL,14,FJack Jones, 40, was banned from keeping
OL,15,Fanimals for 10 years.
OL,17,FThere was more animal cruelty uncovered
OL,18,Fin footage filmed secretly at Two Pools
OL,19,Fdairy farm near Bristol. Mike King, the
OL,20,Fowner, said he was appalled to see
OL,21,Fworkers kicking cows and force-feeding
OL,22,Fone calf until it choked and died.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
