OL,3,GNEWSA'Collapsed bridge findings' and
OL,4,A'Animal cruelty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issue of electric vehicle charging
OL,7,Fcables trailing unsafely across
OL,8,Fpavements in Swindon is under
OL,9,Fdiscussion. A motion has been put
OL,10,Fbefore councillors highlighting the
OL,11,Ftrip hazards the cables can cause,
OL,12,Faccording to the Swindon Advertiser.
